&lt;p style="margin-left: 18px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -12px"&gt;・直営店の収益性の著しい低下や退店の意思決定が発生する可能性がある&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000; width: 124.06666666666666666666666667px; vertical-align: top; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 18px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -12px"&gt;・減損損失の発生&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000; width: 129px; vertical-align: top; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 18px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -12px"&gt;・店舗の収益性を維持・向上&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 18px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -12px"&gt;・本社費等の削減により全社の収益性を向上&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td style="border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000; width: 23.466666666666666666666666667px; vertical-align: top; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px"&gt;
